  "description": "SEPBAU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H80 Gd4 N8 O22,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.690-4.198 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.33-129.35°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C58H88Gd4N8O24. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
